                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 121,
                            "playtime_at_review": 121,
                            "last_played": 1793413967
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I freaking adore this specific flavor of edgy shit!!! \nThe title being 'murder' in reverse (also likely a Stephen King reference), the evil psychiatrist's name being literally Sigmund Fraud (as a Freud hater I particularly fancy this). The random skulls, syringes, venomous snakes and trauma everywhere. \nMy beloved LOBOTOMY!!!!!! \nThen in the actual gameplay the sheer randomness of the items, digging through a garbage pile including rotting putrid objects that no sane being would consider stepping close to. And of course the story is implausible and overly straight-forward with cartoonish degree of evil.\nThere's such a beauty in those older mystery Hidden Object games which people tend to overhate (perhaps for good reasons but I don't care). But can only recommend on sale, it's short!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1793413722,
